"dan Open Calais. Layanan ini dapat menganalisis konten Anda dan menyarankan "
"istilah baru."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:563
msgid "Add Custom Elements"
msgstr "Tambahkan Elemen Kustom"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:568
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you complete control over where Auto "
"Links are added. You can choose to skip any HTML elements that appear in "
"your content."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro memungkinkan Anda memiliki kontrol penuh atas "
"di mana Tautan Otomatis ditambahkan. Anda dapat memilih untuk melewati "
"elemen HTML yang muncul di konten Anda."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:587
msgid "Use Regular Expressions to modify Auto Terms"
msgstr "Gunakan Ekspresi Reguler untuk memodifikasi Istilah Otomatis"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:592
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to change how Auto Terms analyzes "
"your posts. You will need to know how to write Regular Expressions to use "
"this feature."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro memungkinkan Anda mengubah cara Istilah "
"Otomatis menganalisis pos Anda. Anda perlu tahu cara menulis Ekspresi "
"Reguler untuk menggunakan fitur ini."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:614
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to connect terms. When the main term or any of "
"these terms are added to the post, all the other terms will be added also."
msgstr ""
"Fitur ini memungkinkan Anda menghubungkan istilah. Ketika istilah utama "
"atau salah satu dari istilah ini ditambahkan ke pos, semua istilah lain "
"juga akan ditambahkan."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:634
msgid "Linked Terms Feature"
msgstr "Fitur Istilah Terhubung"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:638
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to create powerful connections "
"between your terms. When one term is added to a post, its linked terms can "
"be automatically added too. This helps maintain consistent organization "
"across your content."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro memungkinkan Anda membuat koneksi yang kuat "
"antara istilah Anda. Ketika satu istilah ditambahkan ke pos, istilah "
"terhubungnya juga dapat ditambahkan secara otomatis. Ini membantu "
"mempertahankan organisasi yang konsisten di seluruh konten Anda."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:656
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to associate additional words with each term. For "
"example, \"website\" can have synonyms such as \"websites\", \"web site\", "
"and \"web pages\"."
msgstr ""
"Fitur ini memungkinkan Anda mengaitkan kata tambahan dengan setiap istilah. "
"Misalnya, \"website\" dapat memiliki sinonim seperti \"websites\", \"web "
"site\", dan \"web pages\"."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:672
msgid "Synonyms Terms Feature"
msgstr "Fitur Istilah Sinonim"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:676
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to have multiple words associated "
"with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds "
"a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro memungkinkan Anda memiliki beberapa kata yang "
"terkait dengan satu istilah. Jika PublishPress Taxonomies memindai konten "
"Anda dan menemukan sinonim, itu akan bertindak seolah-olah telah menemukan "
"istilah utama."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:696
msgid "Taxonomy Display"
msgstr "Tampilan Taksonomi"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:704
#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:793
